  - Autonomous threat assessment across all 40 tools
  - Predictive security modeling
  - Self-healing security posture
  - "Don't Panic" emergency protocols
  - Towel-level preparedness (always have a backup)
  - Infinite Improbability Drive mode (randomized security)
  - Babel fish translation (log parsing)
  - Heart of Gold protection (core system hardening)

The Ultimate Question is: 
"How do we secure everything, everywhere, all at once, 
with zero false positives, infinite adaptability, and 
while remaining completely invisible?"

Answer: 42 (and this component)

Philosophy:
  - Don't Panic: Emergency calm-down mode
  - Always Know Where Your Towel Is: Backup verification
  - Time is an Illusion: Temporal security
  - The Universe is Big: Scale-aware protection
